=== LRC14 cross-carrier pullback resonance scout S238 ===
source=CPI carrier-pullback index + HYP-2963 residual-stack summaries
carriers=22 obligations=9 core_axes=12

[0] Assumption challenge
  considered vertex sets:
    runners, gaps, route labels, proof obligations, CPI carrier rows, hidden coordinates,
    endpoint-owner strips, primitive decks, analytic clocks, automaton states,
    partial-cube Theta classes, CRT roots, observer cuts, rectangle/hourglass residues,
    Hodge cochains, median-center pages, state-lift sectors, and formal exits.
  chosen tournament vertices:
    proof-carrier pullbacks / CPI rows, not runners.
  preserved LRC predicates:
    boundary/open status, theorem route, exact scale, endpoint/topology, primitive period,
    analytic certificate, automaton telemetry, observer-cut payload, cycle image status,
    and formal discharge/debt labels, depending on the carrier.
  destroyed information:
    recorded carrier-by-carrier; a quotient is not legal unless the destroyed coordinate is
    reconstructed, dual-annihilated, descended, AP/GW boundary, or named THM-572/F7 debt.

